				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-621091/special-assets#post-2283735</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2015 22:10:37 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>El-Drago-800</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1519713</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>SCP-191 is called Brigitte? I'll admit, I like when human SCP items (at least the more harmless/sympathetic ones) get given names. It helps show that despite their anomalies, their still human beings. I know the Foundation don't see them as &quot;human beings&quot;, but that doesn't mean the reader has to.</p> <p>+1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
