					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I think it's just that right there. That she's getting a chance to do things, be to useful, not just get locked up for all time because of what happened to her. I know a lot of people don't like the idea of &quot;X-Men&quot; teams of scips running around, but you go to attempt, you could put a pretty potent line up together with what they do have available.</p> 
				 	]]>
