					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-621091#post-1840032</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-621091/special-assets#post-1840032</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 26 Aug 2013 05:15:25 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>thorgold</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1183797</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Y'know, in rereading 191's description, I noticed that - in standard canon - she's the only survivor of the raid. &quot;All other test subjects expired during the raid (either disposed of by Dr. █████████, or eliminated as hostiles by the task force).&quot;</p> <p>So in the universe where there's no Foundation and the operation is purely GOC, the kids <em>live</em> and recover, even. Score 1 GOC.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
